// microbench hop1p3_knows: firstName, lastName, gender of every distinct knows-neighbor of a
// person, sorted by firstName.
// Reads: the knows edge index (both sides), then each distinct friend's document.
// Evaluator: queries/hop.py _hop1p(3) -- read_neighbors + dedup + read_vertex_props(3 props),
// one row per friend.
// mb2 lineage: MB21-26 (width x fan-out cross, MICROBENCH2 #2).
FOR v IN 1..1 ANY CONCAT("Person/", @personId) knows
    OPTIONS {order: "bfs", uniqueVertices: "global"}
    SORT v.firstName
    RETURN {firstName: v.firstName, lastName: v.lastName, gender: v.gender}
